  "about": "Cinema 4D + Redshift/Octane 或 Blender 渲染的实体质感动画：软胶、玻璃、金属、布料，配合克隆阵列和物理模拟。是高端产品片（手机、饮料、球鞋）和品牌 ident 的主流，Maxon 官方 Demo Reel 就是该风格的年度风向标。",
  "about_en": "Solid, tactile animation rendered in Cinema 4D with Redshift/Octane, or in Blender: soft rubber, glass, metal, cloth, with cloner arrays and physics simulation. The mainstream look for high-end product films (phones, drinks, sneakers) and brand idents; Maxon's official demo reel sets the trend each year.",
  "how": "Blender Cycles 渲染：blender/sim.py 算出全部运动，scene.py 搭场景，render.py 出序列帧；index.html 再叠上文字和颗粒合成。序列帧体积大，没有收录。",
