  "about": "大面积高斯模糊的彩色光斑（aurora/mesh gradient）缓慢漂移作底，磨砂半透明玻璃卡片浮在其上。苹果 iOS 26 Liquid Glass 与各家 AI 产品发布把这一风格推成 2024-2026 科技品牌片的默认视觉，气质是'慢、透、高级'。",
  "about_en": "Large, heavily blurred colour blobs (aurora / mesh gradient) drift slowly underneath, with frosted translucent glass cards floating on top. Apple's iOS 26 Liquid Glass and a wave of AI product launches made it the default look of tech brand films in 2024–2026: slow, translucent, premium.",
