  "about": "对特定年代媒介美学的整体引用：80s synthwave 是霓虹网格+日落渐变+镀铬字；VHS 是扫描线+色偏+磁带噪声；Y2K 千禧风是液态镀铬金属、酸性绿紫、拟物系统窗口和低保真 3D。近两年 Y2K 在音乐视频与潮流品牌片中强势回潮，B站模板市场大量供应'酸性镀铬'素材。",
  "about_en": "A wholesale quotation of one era's media aesthetics: 80s synthwave is neon grids, sunset gradients and chrome type; VHS is scanlines, colour shift and tape noise; Y2K is liquid chrome, acid green and purple, skeuomorphic system windows and lo-fi 3D. Y2K has come back strongly in music videos and fashion brand films over the last two years, and Bilibili's template market is full of \"acid chrome\" assets.",
